.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
The state machine does not validate escape sequence parameters.
Malformed sequences are silently consumed (bytes are dropped rather than
passed through).
.IP \(bu 2
The \f[CR]active\f[R] field in the state struct is not checked by
\f[CR]ansi_strip()\f[R] itself; the caller (PTY relay loop) checks it
before calling.
If called with \f[CR]active == 0\f[R], the function still strips
sequences.
